          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Talk about thermometers and how they are used to measure temperature. Bring a laboratory thermometer to the class and measure the temperature of hot water and cold water. Point out to children that there are markings in the thermometer that are below "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "0 ^ { \\circ } \\mathbb { C } ,"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " . Have a discussion on what "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "0 ^ { \\circ } \\mathbb { C }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " indicates, namely, the freezing point of water."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
